<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round</p>
<p>results from the $107,500 Styria Open women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeds):</p>
<p>Amelie Cocheteux (France) beat Petra Schwarz (Austria) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>4-Patti Schnyder (Switzerland) beat Sandra Kleinova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>7-Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat Marion Maruska</p>
<p>(Austria) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Meike Babel (Germany) beat Karin Kschwendt (Austria) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 3-6 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Laura Garrone (Italy) beat Petra Langrova (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>3-Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Stephanie De Ville (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Gala Leon Garcia (Spain) beat Sofia Prazeres (Portugal) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>8-Virginia Ruano Pascual (Spain) beat Flora Perfetti (Italy)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
